course: dictionary
lesson: 12418
title: Darkened and the word darken
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Darken is a verb. It means to make something darker, or to grow darker. Darkened is its past form, so it tells us something has already happened: «The sky darkened as the storm came closer.» The sky grew darker, and it happened in the past.
explain: Darkened can also describe a thing. «We sat in a darkened room to watch the shadow puppets.» A darkened room is a room with little light. You can use the ending to check: if something has been made darker, the word darkened fits.
explain: Look at the clues around the word. The storm, the shadows and the lamps tell you what darkened means before you check a dictionary. Swap in your meaning, such as «grew dark», and see if the sentence still makes sense.
fact: Darken means to make darker, or to grow darker.
fact: Darkened is the past form of darken: darken, darkens, darkened, darkening.
fact: As an adjective, darkened describes a place with little light, such as a darkened room or darkened windows.
fact: «Darkened» can show a change over time, as in «The sky darkened».
fact: Darkened is the opposite of lit up, which means full of light.
exercise: «The sky darkened as the storm came closer.» What does darkened mean? | Became warmer | Became brighter | *Became darker | Became louder
exercise: Which word means the opposite of darkened? | Shadowy | *Lit up | Gloomy | Dark
exercise: «We sat in a darkened room to watch the shadow puppets.» What is darkened describing? | The puppets | The shadows | *The room | The children
test: «The windows of the old house were darkened by thick ivy.» What does darkened tell you? | The windows were newly cleaned | The windows were open wide | *The windows had less light getting in | The windows were made of glass
test: Which word is the past form of darken? | darkens | darker | darkening | *darkened
exam: «The street darkened, and the lamps flickered on one by one.» What happened to the street? | *It grew dark | It was filled with people | Its walls were painted black | It was made wider
